.mcp.json
*.md
!STYLE-GUIDE.md

!**/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/agents/*
!.claude/commands/*
!.claude/rules/*
!.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/**/SKILL.md

!private_dot_config/**/commands/*.md
!private_dot_config/**/skills/**/*.md

# Markdown under private_dot_config/ is repo documentation living in the chezmoi
# source tree — versioned here, kept out of ~ by .chezmoiignore. The blanket
# *.md above relied on a hand-maintained exception list and was silently hiding
# hypr/conf/bindings/README.md and themes/style-guide-generator.md, so neither
# could ever be committed. Negate by location, not by filename, so a new doc
# added here is versioned by default instead of vanishing on a fresh clone.
!private_dot_config/**/*.md

!_plans/**/**.md
!_research/**/**.md
!_guides/**/**.md

__pycache__